" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">%</span><span id="lstnumberx63.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx63.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">26))</span>
